# What may never enter a build image: secrets, local state, and anything the
# images rebuild from source anyway.
.git
.env
.env.*
apps/web/.env.local

# dependency and build output — every image reinstalls/rebuilds these
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# foundry build output and broadcast history — the seed container compiles fresh
crucible-contracts/out
crucible-contracts/cache
crucible-contracts/broadcast

# repo tooling and prose no image reads
docs
.github
scripts
*.md
